    "sentence_translations": [
      "The KFC You Don’t Know",
      "",
      "Dragon Twister, Pork & Preserved Egg Congee, Mapo Chicken Rice, and Safe Fried Dough Sticks…",
      "Where can you eat these things?",
      "Believe it or not, you can eat these at KFC in China.",
      "",
      "In your mind KFC may be a place that sells chicken nuggets.",
      "But in the eyes of Chinese it is much more than a place that just sells nuggets.",
      "In China, if you enter KFC in the morning you can have a Chinese breakfast.",
      "With fried dough sticks, soy milk, steamed buns and rice porridge…",
      "At noon in KFC, you can have a cup of Chinese beverage like bubble tea or herbal tea.",
      "In the evening, you can have a Chinese-Western mixed dinner such as Dragon Twister, Drumstick Rice, or Steamed Burger…",
      "",
      "Each year KFC launches new meals that are only available in China, you might as well give it a try!",
      ""
    ]
  }
